    {
      "subId": "7300201",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Withering Zone that needs to be cleaned up",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730020101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730020101": {
            "id": "730020101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Whew, it's nice to have the chance to do something. This should help with our problem a little.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020102"
            ]
          },
          "730020102": {
            "id": "730020102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Besides, watching you fight made me realize that I still have a lot to learn, {NICKNAME}! Like footwork... and timing too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020103"
            ]
          },
          "730020103": {
            "id": "730020103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "An experienced traveler like you is just... absolutely amazing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020108",
              "730020107"
            ]
          },
          "730020108": {
            "id": "730020108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Thank you so much, really. That reminds me, how's your condition, {NICKNAME}? After taking care of so many Withering Zones, do you feel dizzy or nauseous or anything?"
          },
          "730020107": {
            "id": "730020107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh, well, we're always improving together as companions!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300217",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Rana",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730021001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730021001": {
            "id": "730021001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Here we are. When I was little, I would often take this road to go down to the river valley to play.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021002"
            ]
          },
          "730021002": {
            "id": "730021002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "The Withering Zones are appearing so quickly now, and Tighnari and the others are too busy to deal with them in time. But it's a good thing we have you here now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021003"
            ]
          },
          "730021003": {
            "id": "730021003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Leave it to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021004"
            ]
          },
          "730021004": {
            "id": "730021004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Okay! You made clean work of those Withering Zones before, but they're still dangerous. If it gets to be too much, be sure to leave the realm and take some rest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300202",
      "subQuestName": "Clean up the Withering Zone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730020201": {
            "id": "730020201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Here we are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020202"
            ]
          },
          "730020202": {
            "id": "730020202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's that round thing at the edge, the thing that looks like a small cabin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020203"
            ]
          },
          "730020203": {
            "id": "730020203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Oh, that... I'm not sure where it came from, but you see them all the time in the forests of Sumeru. Maybe it's some kind of ruin!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020204"
            ]
          },
          "730020204": {
            "id": "730020204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Strange, since you've asked, I seem to have heard about this kind of house and its resident. Who was it again... It wasn't that researcher who's in Satyavada Life...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020205"
            ]
          },
          "730020205": {
            "id": "730020205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Oh, never mind! {NICKNAME}, Paimon, wait here for a second! I'm gonna go tidy up the campsite, get a fire going, and get some ingredients ready!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020207"
            ]
          },
          "730020207": {
            "id": "730020207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let us help you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020209"
            ]
          },
          "730020209": {
            "id": "730020209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "I can't have that! I was the one who asked you to come and help clean up the Withering Zones...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020210"
            ]
          },
          "730020210": {
            "id": "730020210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Just think of us as trainee Forest Watchers! What do you need us to do, Rana?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020211"
            ]
          },
          "730020211": {
            "id": "730020211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Well, if you insist, Paimon... Hmm... Could you help me get some firewood then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020212"
            ]
          },
          "730020212": {
            "id": "730020212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#All you need is some wood chopped? That's nothing, {NICKNAME} could do that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300203",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Withering Zone that needs to be cleaned up",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730020301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730020301": {
            "id": "730020301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "You guys are back! I'm almost done here as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020302"
            ]
          },
          "730020302": {
            "id": "730020302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Will these be enough, Rana?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020303"
            ]
          },
          "730020303": {
            "id": "730020303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Yep, that's more than enough!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020304"
            ]
          },
          "730020304": {
            "id": "730020304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Oh, right! One of our camping traditions is to have the most esteemed person in the group light the campfire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020308",
              "730020307"
            ]
          },
          "730020308": {
            "id": "730020308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Leave it to us!"
          },
          "730020307": {
            "id": "730020307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really, quit fooling around! Don't act like we haven't burned anything along our journey..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300221",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Rana",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730021101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730021101": {
            "id": "730021101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "This Withering Zone's expanding...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021102"
            ]
          },
          "730021102": {
            "id": "730021102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Regardless, I'll leave it in your capable hands just like before, {NICKNAME}. Just don't overdo it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021105"
            ]
          },
          "730021105": {
            "id": "730021105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Thanks, {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300204",
      "subQuestName": "Clean up the Withering Zone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730020401": {
            "id": "730020401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Using the supplies stored at the campsite and the ingredients gathered along the way, Rana makes a pot of richly fragrant curry.\\nEveryone stuffs their faces.\\nThe rest is packed up in containers for later use.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020402"
            ]
          },
          "730020402": {
            "id": "730020402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "...Ahh! It's so good. Curry tastes even better after hard work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020404"
            ]
          },
          "730020404": {
            "id": "730020404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon doesn't care about such things!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020406"
            ]
          },
          "730020406": {
            "id": "730020406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, this curry is so aromatic. What if the smell draws some critters or hilichurls over here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020407"
            ]
          },
          "730020407": {
            "id": "730020407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "\"Curry, curry, in the air~ Hungry children it's time to come home~♪\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020408"
            ]
          },
          "730020408": {
            "id": "730020408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "This is a children's song from Sumeru. There's something free about curry — each family adds different ingredients and spices depending on how they make it. So, each family's curry has its own flavor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020409"
            ]
          },
          "730020409": {
            "id": "730020409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "So, when we were little, we could smell a curry and tell whether it was made by our parents.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020410"
            ]
          },
          "730020410": {
            "id": "730020410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "But once we got older, we couldn't tell whose curry was whose anymore. They all seem about the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020411"
            ]
          },
          "730020411": {
            "id": "730020411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "But still, you know that it's time to go home and eat when you smell curry!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730020412"
            ]
          },
          "730020412": {
            "id": "730020412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Curry, curry, in the air~♪\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300205",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the area where the Spinocrocodiles are active",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
