    {
      "subId": "7300220",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Rana",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730021201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730021201": {
            "id": "730021201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Forest Watchers are also tasked with protecting the ecosystem. Recently, potentially because of the Withering Zones, the alligators have become... shall we say, unusually manic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021202"
            ]
          },
          "730021202": {
            "id": "730021202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Not only have they been invading other animals' territories, but they're reproducing at a faster rate. If this goes on, they won't just be a danger to the children, but to the forest's ecosystem as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021203"
            ]
          },
          "730021203": {
            "id": "730021203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "#Luckily, your opponent isn't a Withering Zone this time. It's my time to shine, hehe. You rest up, {NICKNAME}, leave this one to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021206"
            ]
          },
          "730021206": {
            "id": "730021206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We're coming to help too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730021207"
            ]
          },
          "730021207": {
            "id": "730021207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Is it really okay...? That's great then, I'll finally get to fight side by side with you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7300222",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat a certain number of Spinocrocodiles",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730022201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730022201": {
            "id": "730022201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "One of our camping traditions is to have the most esteemed person in the group light the campfire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730022202"
            ]
          },
          "730022202": {
            "id": "730022202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Why the tradition? Probably because in the era of darkness, fire was a symbol of warmth and courage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730022203"
            ]
          },
          "730022203": {
            "id": "730022203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The era of darkness?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730022204"
            ]
          },
          "730022204": {
            "id": "730022204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Right. The origins of the Forest Rangers go way back. The earliest rangers were the forest king's royal guards! I heard that they once walked in forests where there were real tigers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730022205"
            ]
          },
          "730022205": {
            "id": "730022205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "Later, Khaenri'ah fell, and thus began the era of darkness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730022206"
            ]
          },
          "730022206": {
            "id": "730022206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Rana",
            "text": "But not many documents have survived the cataclysm, so no one really knows what exactly happened. Still, I want to see a real tiger!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
